<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 20.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers (dollar/bu)</p>
<p>					South of Peoria  change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.68-2.76		up 4-7</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.09-7.17		up 11-15</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.74-2.78		up 3</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 7.13-7.18		up 9-12</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.72-2.74		up 4-7</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.13-7.16		up 14-16</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.73-2.74		up 4</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.11-7.12		up 11-12</p>
<p>Source: USDA (Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
